# @name login
POST {{url}}/auth/signin
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "douglasdev.cn@gmail.com",
  "password": 1234
}
###

@authToken = {{login.response.body.$.access_token}}

@endpoint = /departments

#### 1) Listar setores
GET {{url}}{{endpoint}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

#### 2) Buscar setor por id
GET {{url}}{{endpoint}}/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

#### 3) Criar setor
POST {{url}}{{endpoint}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "name": "Suporte",
  "description": "Atendimento técnico"
}

###

#### 4) Atualizar setor
PATCH {{url}}{{endpoint}}/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "name": "Suporte técnico"
}

###

#### 5) Listar membros do setor (usuários ativos + quem já está no setor)
GET {{url}}{{endpoint}}/1/users
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

#### 6) Atualizar membros do setor (substitui a lista inteira)
PATCH {{url}}{{endpoint}}/1/users
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "user_ids": [1, 2]
}

###

#### 7) Remover setor (desvincula usuários)
DELETE {{url}}{{endpoint}}/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
